The '''royal prison''' was a [[prison]] in [[Sundari]], [[Mandalore]]. It was suspended from the ceiling of the city's [[Bio-cube|bio-dome]]. [[Duchess]] [[Satine Kryze]] was imprisoned here when she attempted to expose [[Prime Minister]] [[Almec]]'s [[Mandalorian black market conspiracy|black market conspiracy]],<ref name="TA" /> and again during [[Death Watch]]'s [[Takeover of Mandalore|coup]].<ref name="Shades of Reason" />

Almec was detained in the prison after his defeat and capture by the [[Mandalore resistance]] during the [[Siege of Mandalore]]. As he was being questioned by [[Ahsoka Tano]] and [[Bo-Katan Kryze]], Almec was assassinated by [[Gar Saxon]] to prevent him revealing information about [[Maul]]. Kryze pursued Saxon through the prison complex, but he escaped.<ref name="Phantom Apprentice" />

